WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
What links slopes and areas?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.870
Grow the area under a curve a tiny bit.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:10.900
The new strip is the curve's height × its width.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.090
So the area grows at a rate equal to the height.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:21.013
Area and slope undo each other.
